DERATE"],"有點吵雜",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjup-PfwdKWAxW_ePUHHeclNYsQ3YcHCJQBKAA"]],1],null,null,"吵雜程度",null,"0ahUKEwjup-PfwdKWAxW_ePUHHeclNYsQ3IcHCJMBKAc",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["冷盤小菜不錯吃, 龍鬚菜份量有點少, 吃幾口就沒了, 豆腐飽足感比較夠; 我喜歡偏硬的拉麵條, 煮得剛剛好; 薄薄的叉燒肉有炙燒烤過的味道, 舒肥雞胸肉也不錯, 不乾柴, 整個泡在拉麵裡面再吃味道也挺好的, 糖心蛋和唐揚雞就比較普通。各家拉麵湯頭都很鹹, 有時仍然會忍不住喝個一兩口, 三不五時會有期間限定口味, 不妨試試。店內座位不多, 餐期間肯定客滿, 採用自助回收餐盤。這一帶附近不好停車, 路邊停車格要碰運氣; 整體來說性價比還可以, 偏小貴, 份量稍稍少了一點, 要點多一些小菜才能吃飽。有不少分店, 簡單吃一吃這家是蠻適合的。",null,[0,269]]]],[null,1770035212000000,1770035212000000,"7 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfeXNXQmFtQldkNEpDR1FDWG8waXpNdw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfeXNXQmFtQldkNEpDR1FDWG8waXpNdxoTQ2d3SWpMQ0N6QVlReTdDRnRBTQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjup-PfwdKWAxW_ePUHHeclNYsQ_2MIlQEoCA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1622216000888302996/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV3YTFkVVdsZGtSa3BJWkVaTk1GVXlOVWxTVkdnMVkxVjBUV0pZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1622216000888302996/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV3YTFkVVdsZGtSa3BJWkVaTk1GVXlOVWxTVkdnMVkxVjBUV0pZWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1622216000888302996/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV3YTFkVVdsZGtSa3BJWkVaTk1GVXlOVWxTVkdnMVkxVjBUV0pZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1622216000888302996/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV3YTFkVVdsZGtSa3BJWkVaTk1GVXlOVWxTVkdnMVkxVjBUV0pZWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1622216000888302996/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV3YTFkVVdsZGtSa3BJWkVaTk1GVXlOVWxTVkdnMVkxVjBUV0pZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1622216000888302996/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV3YTFkVVdsZGtSa3BJWkVaTk1GVXlOVWxTVkdnM